WEBVTT

00:56:28.311 --> 00:56:30.906
that you'd consider reading,
all or in part of?

00:56:30.930 --> 00:56:32.446
I don't know how long they are.

00:56:32.470 --> 00:56:37.303
EG: You're putting me on the spot.
Let me see what we've got.

00:56:38.164 --> 00:56:39.314
Let's see.

00:56:39.875 --> 00:56:41.025
(Inaudible)

00:56:44.104 --> 00:56:45.304
OK, so here's one.

00:56:45.328 --> 00:56:49.652
So I was panicking because
I want to offer my apartment in New York

00:56:49.676 --> 00:56:52.248
to a woman who is a COVID-19 nurse

00:56:52.272 --> 00:56:54.851
who's volunteered
to come into New York City to help,

00:56:54.875 --> 00:56:58.589
and I'm afraid
that I'll infect my neighbors

00:56:58.613 --> 00:57:00.468
if I let her come and stay there.